Mon Nov 16 19:05:12 UTC 2026 - Martin Hauke <mardnh@gmx.de>

- Update to version 2.12.0
  * Require 112-bit OTP secrets and update illustrative examples.
  * Limit TOTP intervals to 120 seconds.
  * Update recommendations for authentication best practices.
  * Update required minimum Python version to 3.10 .
- Update to version 2.11.2
  * Validate OTP configuration and URI parameters (#203).
  * Harden OTP verification APIs and document replay prevention
    (#202).
- Update to version 2.11.1
  * Fix PyPI README markup and validate distributions before
    release.
- Update to version 2.11.0
  * Fix DST rollbacks and normalize TOTP timestamp inputs (#197).
  * Respect initial_count=0 in HOTP.provisioning_uri() (#190).
  * Implement verify_and_get_timecode, a method for TOTP that
    verifies and returns the matching timecode (#191).

-------------------------------------------------------------------
Sun Jun 14 17:21:34 UTC 2026 - Martin Hauke <mardnh@gmx.de>

- Update to version 2.10.0
  * Fix parse_uri mis-parsing of encoded colon in issuer/account
    name.
  * Simplified and improved generate_otp() performance in Steam
    class.
  * Check digest function to prevent error on OTP Generation.
  * Ignore non-standard otpauth parameters.
  * use strings as immutable default arguments.

